@startuml
title Green Rides - State Machine Diagram

[*] --> LoggedOut

state LoggedOut
LoggedOut --> Login : user initiates login

state Login
Login : entry / request login
Login : do / authenticate user
Login --> JourneyDetails : authentication successful
Login --> LoggedOut : authentication failed

state JourneyDetails
JourneyDetails : entry / display journey details
JourneyDetails : do / show destination and route
JourneyDetails --> DrivingMode : user selects driving mode
JourneyDetails --> EatOptions : user selects eat options
JourneyDetails --> Feedback : journey completed

state DrivingMode
DrivingMode : entry / activate driving mode
DrivingMode --> Accident : accident occurs
DrivingMode --> Feedback : journey completed

state EatOptions
EatOptions : entry / display restaurant options
EatOptions : do / show menu and allow ordering
EatOptions --> DrivingMode : order placed
EatOptions --> JourneyDetails : user cancels

state Accident
Accident : entry / accident detected
Accident : do / notify authorities
Accident --> DrivingMode : driving resumes
Accident --> Feedback : journey completed

state Feedback
Feedback : entry / request feedback
Feedback : do / collect user feedback
Feedback --> LoggedOut : feedback submitted

Feedback --> [*] : COMPLETION_EVENT
@enduml
